WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.790
- [Narrator] This Great
Big Story was made possible

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.200
by Wells Fargo.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.860
Established 1852.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.573
Re-established 2018.

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:12.292
(intense metal music)

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:41.270
- [Narrator] Okay, so "Mad Max"
or Comic-Con in the desert?

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:42.183
Nope.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.081
This is Winter Metal Mania Fest.

00:00:46.081 --> 00:00:48.270
- Hey!
(growls)

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.560
- [Narrator] Just a bunch of
metalheads that want to prove

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.298
that Botswana can thrash
as good as the rest.

00:00:53.298 --> 00:00:55.381
(growls)

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.253
And none go harder than these guys.

00:01:17.353 --> 00:01:18.652
- [Man] Welcome!

00:01:18.652 --> 00:01:19.800
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.320
- [Narrator] The die-hard death metal band

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.990
formed back in 2008

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:24.160
and have worked their way to become

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.043
one of the country's leading acts.

00:01:26.996 --> 00:01:30.163
(intense metal music)

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:00.360
- [Narrator] Botswana might
not be the first country

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.013
that comes to mind for this.

00:02:02.013 --> 00:02:02.960
(intense guitar music)

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:03.793
Or this.

00:02:03.793 --> 00:02:05.400
(intense metal music)

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:07.550
But the metal scene
here has some momentum.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.530
- [Narrator] For nine years,

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.750
Overthrust has been
headlining their festival,

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:28.463
part of a lineup that now hosts
acts from all over Africa.

00:02:44.829 --> 00:02:46.359
(audience cheers)

00:02:46.359 --> 00:02:49.776
- [Man] This song is
called "Soul to Feed!"

00:02:50.713 --> 00:02:52.150
(intense metal music)

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.510
- [Narrator] And for Vulture Thrust,

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:55.180
like any true metalhead,

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.353
it's about so much more than the music.

